# Record Button — inverted 2-page FlatList: scrolling the dark "Scroll" page away
# draws a Skia outline around a "Record" pill (progress from the scroll offset),
# which fills/scales up past 0.98 (haptic); release past 0.97 snaps to the
# record page, tapping Record scrolls back.
# What this test covers: a small scroll (progress < threshold, springs back
# to the first page), a partial scroll that stops mid-outline, a full scroll
# that snaps to the Record page, pressing Record to scroll back, a fling,
# scrolling back down by hand from the Record page, and pressing Record
# repeatedly while the scroll-back is running.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/record-button"
wait "text" "Scroll" 10000
wait 1000
# Small drag: progress below 0, page returns.
gesture pan 200 300 0 60 600
wait 1000
# Partial: outline partly drawn, snaps back.
gesture pan 200 300 0 160 900
wait 1200
# Full: snaps to the Record page.
gesture pan 200 250 0 400 900
wait 1200
wait "label=\"Record\"" 3000
press "label=\"Record\""
wait 1200
wait "text" "Scroll" 3000
# Fling up to Record, scroll back by hand.
gesture fling down 200 300 300
wait 1500
gesture pan 200 650 0 -400 900
wait 1200
gesture pan 200 250 0 400 900
wait 1200
# Record pressed repeatedly during the scroll-back.
press "label=\"Record\""
wait 100
press 201 815
wait 100
press 201 815
wait 1500
wait "label=\"Close\"" 3000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\" id=\"xmark\""
wait 1500
